{
  "slug": "good-boy-supply",
  "name": "Good Boy Supply",
  "version": "1.0.0",
  "description": "A cheerful pet store built with Pursae Web Builder: a bold navy header with the language switcher and a hover mini-cart, a sunny hero, rounded category tiles, bestsellers and new arrivals, a product page with size variations, tabs and related gear, and a friendly checkout. Every part is a Theme Builder template you can edit visually. Fredoka and Nunito, self-hosted. Ships a complete store demo: beds, harnesses in three sizes, cat furniture, toys, care and a puppy starter kit.",
